DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at
	 no extra cost to you. \nGet Tickets \nAbout the Show\nGet ready for the t
	ime of your life at EastVille\, Brooklyn’s legendary comedy club! This his
	toric venue has hosted world-renowned comedians like Chris Rock\, Mel Broo
	ks\, and Joan Rivers for ages. \nThe best part? No minimum drink order is 
	required — just your ticket on your smartphone! Enjoy stress-free seating 
	with plenty of options\, and treat yourself to specially-crafted cocktails
	 and delicious homemade popcorn. You’re guaranteed to be in stitches for a
	 full hour and 30 minutes! \nEvent Details\nDate: Various dates available 
	(select during purchase)\nTime: 8:00 PM and 9:45 PM shows\nDuration: 90 mi
	nutes\nLocation: Eastville Comedy Club\, 487 Atlantic Avenue\, Brooklyn\, 
	NY 11217\nAge Requirement: All ages welcome\; children under 16 must be ac
	companied by an adult\nAccessibility: Wheelchair accessible\nNote: All sal
	es are final. \nAbout the Venue\nEastville Comedy Club is located at 487 A
	tlantic Avenue in Brooklyn\, NY. This historic venue is easily accessible 
	via the Atlantic Ave B/Q subway stop\, Nevins St 2/3/4/5\, and Hoyt-Scherm
	erhorn A/C/G stations. \nWhat to Expect\nLaugh along with world-renowned c
	omedians in a stress-free\, welcoming environment. Enjoy specially-crafted
	 cocktails and delicious homemade popcorn with no drink minimum required. 
	Every night features a unique rotating lineup guaranteed to deliver belly 
	laughs. \nTicket Information\nGeneral Admission tickets are $30.00. No boo
	king fees. All ages welcome. All sales are final. \nGet Tickets\n\nhttps:/
	/comedycalendar.com/event/eastville-comedy-club-live-at-eastville-comedy-c
	lub/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/eastville-comedy-club-live-at-eastvill
	e-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Eastville Comedy Club\, 487 Atlantic Avenue\, Brooklyn\, NY\, 1121
	7\, United States
