	eup. \nDine before or during the supper club show — the delicious menu fea
	tures nachos\, turkey burgers\, ahi tuna\, salads\, quinoa bowls\, sliders
	\, wings\, and so much more! With tickets priced at only $15\, it’s the mo
	st fun\, inexpensive night out whether you’re on a date\, with friends\, o
	r even flying solo! \nEvent Details\nDate: Various dates available (select
	 during purchase)\nTime: 9:30 PM\nDuration: 90 minutes\nLocation: The Thre
	e Monkeys\, 832 8th Ave\, New York\, NY 10019\nAge Requirement: 21+ \nAbou
	t the Venue\nThe Three Monkeys is located at 832 8th Avenue in midtown Man
	hattan. The venue offers a full dinner menu and an impressive selection of
	 38 unique craft beers\, classy cocktails\, and award-winning wines. \nWha
	t to Expect\nEnjoy an outstanding comic lineup in a relaxed supper club at
	mosphere. Sip on craft beers\, cocktails\, or wines while watching top-tie
	r comedians perform. The intimate setting makes every show feel personal a
	nd memorable. \nTicket Information\nGeneral Admission tickets are $15.00. 
	No booking fees. Age 21+ required. Dinner menu available before and during
