	nAn intimate comedy club experience at Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa\n\nVenu
	e Information\nBricktown Comedy Club Tulsa is Tulsa’s home for live stand-
	up comedy\, located at 5982 S Yale Ave. The intimate venue offers a full b
