SUMMARY:Christian Johnson LIVE at Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club
DTSTAMP:20260809T040748Z
DTSTART:20260809T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets\n\nAbout the Performer\nChristia
	n Johnson is a rising star in comedy with contagious good energy\, a uniqu
	e style\, and refreshing clean comedy. He is best known for his viral come
	dy videos as “Uncle Nathaniel” — the character that took the internet by s
	torm with his signature catchphrase “Lord Have Mer-Say.” \nChristian has g
	ained over 2.5 million followers across his social media platforms and is 
	rapidly making his way to the top of the list of comedians you need to kno
	w. He has shared the stage with countless celebrity comics and has travele
	d nationally and internationally sharing his undeniable talent. \nHis come
	dy is clean\, positive\, and universally relatable — the kind of humor tha
	t brings people together and leaves everyone in the room feeling good. Whe
	ther you know him from his viral videos or are discovering him for the fir
	st time\, Christian Johnson is a performer you won’t forget. \nEvent Detai
	ls\n\nDate: Sunday\, August 9\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:00 PM CDT\nDoors Open: 
	6:00 PM CDT\nVenue: Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\nAddress: 618 NW Loop 410\,
	 San Antonio\, TX 78216\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event — Valid photo ID requi
	red\nContent: Clean comedy\n\nAbout the Venue\nLaugh Out Loud Comedy Club 
	is San Antonio’s premier stand-up comedy destination\, conveniently locate
	d in Park North Plaza at Loop 410 and Blanco — just inside the loop and on
	ly a few miles from the airport. \nThe club features a full bar lounge whe
	re guests can grab a drink before the show\, and a comfortable showroom wi
	th first-come\, first-served seating. Preferred Tables are located center 
	stage for the best views\, while General Admission tables are positioned o
	n the sides and wings. \nThere is a 2-item food or beverage minimum per pe
	rson once seated\, and an 18% service charge applies to all checks in the 
	showroom. Early arrival is strongly recommended to secure your preferred s
	eating. \nWhat to Expect\nChristian Johnson brings the same infectious ene
	rgy from his viral videos to the live stage — amplified and in person. His
	 clean comedy style means this is a show you can enjoy with friends of all
	 backgrounds\, and the laughs are genuine and plentiful throughout. \nExpe
	ct crowd interaction\, hilarious character work\, and the kind of positive
	\, uplifting comedy that reminds you why live stand-up is such a special e
	xperience. Christian’s connection with his audience is immediate and real.
	 \nThis is a Sunday night show at Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club — the perfect
	 way to end your weekend on a high note. Grab your tickets now! \nTicket I
	nformation\n\nGeneral Admission: $25 (+ fees)\nPreferred Seating: $35 (+ f
	ees)\nOrder Limit: 10 tickets per order\n\n\nOfficial TicketsResale Ticket
	s\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purch
	ase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are fin
	al. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry
	.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/christian-johnson-live-at-laugh-out-
	loud-comedy-club/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/christian-johnson-live-at-laugh-out-lo
	ud-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\, 618 Northwest Loop 410\, San Antonio\
	, TX\, 78216\, USA
