SUMMARY:Ali Wong Live LIVE at McCaw Hall
DTSTAMP:20260809T040748Z
DTSTART:20260812T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nAli Wong 
	is one of the biggest comedy stars in the world — an Emmy Award-winning ac
	tress\, comedian\, and writer whose Netflix specials Baby Cobra\, Hard Kno
	ck Wife\, and Don Wong have made her a household name. Known for her fearl
	ess\, hilarious\, and deeply personal comedy about marriage\, motherhood\,
	 and modern life\, Wong has built a massive global following through her s
	tand-up and screen work. \nHer breakout Netflix special Baby Cobra — filme
	d while she was seven months pregnant — became a cultural phenomenon and l
	aunched her into the comedy stratosphere. Since then\, Wong has starred in
	 the Netflix series Beef (for which she won an Emmy)\, Always Be My Maybe\
	, and numerous other projects that have cemented her status as one of ente
	rtainment’s most versatile talents. \nAli Wong Live is her latest stand-up
	 tour\, bringing a brand-new hour of comedy to some of the most prestigiou
	s venues in North America. Seattle’s McCaw Hall hosts two consecutive nigh
	ts — August 12 and 13 — making this one of the most anticipated comedy eve
	nts of the year in the Pacific Northwest. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Wednesd
	ay\, August 12\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:00 PM\nVenue: McCaw Hall\, 321 Mercer 
	Street\, Seattle\, WA 98109\nAge Policy: All Ages\nSeating: Reserved Seate
	d\n\nAbout the Venue\nMcCaw Hall is one of Seattle’s premier performance v
	enues\, located at Seattle Center at 321 Mercer Street. Home to Seattle Op
	era and Pacific Northwest Ballet\, McCaw Hall is a world-class facility wi
	th stunning acoustics\, excellent sightlines\, and a capacity of approxima
	tely 2\,900 guests. \nThe venue features orchestra\, mezzanine\, and balco
	ny seating levels\, offering excellent views from every section. McCaw Hal
	l is conveniently located at Seattle Center\, steps from the Space Needle 
	and easily accessible via the Seattle Center Monorail from downtown. \nPar
	king is available at the Seattle Center Garage and numerous nearby lots. T
	he venue is also accessible via Seattle Metro bus routes. \nWhat to Expect
	\nAli Wong Live is a must-see comedy event — a full evening of stand-up co
	medy from one of the funniest and most celebrated performers working today
	. Expect bold\, hilarious observations about life\, relationships\, and th
	e human experience delivered with Wong’s signature fearless energy. \nWong
	’s live shows are known for their incredible energy and the sense that you
	’re witnessing something truly special. Her ability to connect with audien
	ces through honest\, sometimes shocking humor creates an unforgettable sha
	red experience. \nTicket Information\nTickets for Ali Wong Live at McCaw H
	all are available now. Prices range from $65 to $150 depending on seat sel
	ection. \n\nOfficial Tickets: Purchase directly through Ticketmaster for g
	uaranteed authentic tickets.\nResale Tickets: Find deals on resale tickets
	 through VividSeats.\n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contain
	s affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nht
	tps://comedycalendar.com/event/ali-wong-live-at-mccaw-hall-seattle/\n\nFro
	m Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/ali-wong-live-at-mccaw-hall-seattle/
