DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets\n\nAbout the Performer\nTony Dab
	as\, hailing from Staten Island\, is a rising star in the New York City st
	and-up scene. Known for his quick wit and relatable humor\, Tony has also 
	made a major name for himself in the world of social media\, collaborating
	 with influencers on TikTok and Instagram to create hilarious characters a
	nd viral sketches. \nHis ability to connect with audiences both online and
	 on stage makes him one of the most exciting comedians to watch in the com
	edy world right now. Tony’s comedy draws from his Staten Island roots and 
	New York City experiences\, delivering the kind of sharp\, street-smart hu
	mor that resonates with audiences everywhere. \nWith a rapidly growing fan
	base and a natural talent for both stand-up and character work\, Tony Daba
	s is building a career that is only going to get bigger. Don’t miss your c
	hance to see him live in San Antonio! \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Wednesday\,
	 August 12\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:30 PM CDT\nDoors Open: 6:30 PM CDT\nVenue:
	 Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\nAddress: 618 NW Loop 410\, San Antonio\, TX 7
	8216\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event — Valid photo ID required\nVIP Meet & Gre
	et: Available with VIP ticket purchase\n\nAbout the Venue\nLaugh Out Loud 
	Comedy Club is San Antonio’s premier stand-up comedy destination\, conveni
	ently located in Park North Plaza at Loop 410 and Blanco — just inside the
	 loop and only a few miles from the airport. \nThe club features a full ba
	r lounge where guests can grab a drink before the show\, and a comfortable
	 showroom with first-come\, first-served seating. Preferred Tables are loc
	ated center stage for the best views\, while General Admission tables are 
	positioned on the sides and wings. \nThere is a 2-item food or beverage mi
	nimum per person once seated\, and an 18% service charge applies to all ch
	ecks in the showroom. Early arrival is strongly recommended to secure your
	 preferred seating. \nWhat to Expect\nTony Dabas brings the energy of New 
	York City comedy to the San Antonio stage. His stand-up is fast-paced\, re
	latable\, and packed with the kind of sharp observations that make you lau
	gh because they’re so true. \nVIP ticket holders get the added bonus of a 
	Meet & Greet with Tony before the show — a great opportunity to meet one o
	f comedy’s hottest rising stars up close. VIP seating is located center st
	age for the best view in the house. \nThis is a Wednesday night show at La
	ugh Out Loud Comedy Club — the perfect mid-week pick-me-up. Grab your tick
	ets now! \nTicket Information\n\nGeneral Admission: $25 (+ fees)\nPreferre
	d Seating: $35 (+ fees)\nVIP w/ Meet & Greet: $45 (+ fees)\nOrder Limit: 1
	0 tickets per order\n\n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nThis post conta
	ins affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through 
	our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subje
	ct to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedyc
	alendar.com/event/tony-dabas-live-at-laugh-out-loud-comedy-club/\n\nFrom C
	omedy Calendar
