DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets\nResale Tickets\nAbout Dino Archie\nDino Archi
	e is a stand-up comedian who has been making audiences laugh across the co
	untry with his sharp\, relatable humor and engaging stage presence. Known 
	for his quick wit and ability to find comedy in the everyday moments of li
	fe\, Dino has built a strong following on the comedy club circuit. \nHis c
	omedy style is grounded in personal experience and sharp observation\, dra
	wing laughs from topics that resonate with audiences of all walks of life.
	 Dino’s natural charisma and confident delivery make him a compelling perf
	ormer who commands the stage from the moment he steps on it. \nWith appear
	ances at comedy clubs and festivals across the country\, Dino Archie is a 
	rising force in stand-up comedy. His Sacramento show at the Punch Line is 
	a must-see for fans of smart\, accessible comedy. \nEvent Details\nDate: W
	ednesday\, August 12\, 2026 \nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open one hour before th
	e show) \nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\, 2100 Arden Way\, Sa
	cramento\, CA 95825 \nAge Restriction: 18+ event. Two-beverage minimum per
	 person. No re-entry. \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Comedy Club Sacramento
	 is one of the most celebrated comedy venues on the West Coast\, located a
	t 2100 Arden Way in Sacramento\, California. The intimate club seats appro
	ximately 300 guests in a tiered layout that ensures excellent sightlines f
	rom every seat. \nThe venue features a full bar and dining service\, with 
	a two-beverage minimum per guest. The warm\, welcoming atmosphere and prof
	essional sound system make it the ideal setting for an evening of world-cl
	ass stand-up comedy. Parking is available in the surrounding area. \nPunch
	 Line Sacramento has hosted legends of comedy and continues to be the prem
	ier destination for live stand-up in the Sacramento region. \nWhat to Expe
	ct\nDino Archie delivers a sharp\, engaging stand-up set that blends perso
	nal storytelling with observational humor. Expect a fun Wednesday night ou
	t filled with genuine laughs and a comedian who knows how to work a room. 
	\nThe show runs approximately 75-90 minutes and is an 18+ event with a two
	-beverage minimum. Arrive early to grab your drinks and settle in for a gr
	eat night of comedy. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $29 – $55 (include
	s fees) \nPurchase official tickets through Ticketmaster or find resale op
	tions through VividSeats. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\nThis post co
	ntains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets throu
	gh our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times su
	bject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://come
	dycalendar.com/event/dino-archie-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club-sacramento
	/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
